PR #541 foreground research crash recovery

Policy: initial claim plus at most three automatic expired-lease takeovers. A subsequent
expiry pauses the job and waiting requests with RESEARCH_RECOVERY_LIMIT, clears the lease,
and advances the fencing token. Lifetime attempt remains monotonic. An explicit stopped
Resume or Research again resets only progress.crashRecoveries; paid operation IDs, source
cursors, stage and the preparing snapshot remain. Own-site automatic polling cannot restart
RESEARCH_RECOVERY_LIMIT. Existing background prefetch attempt policy remains unchanged.

Focused real PostgreSQL tests:3/3 PASS,0 skipped,3100.52ms.
- foreground crash recovery stops after three takeovers and explicit resume keeps paid checkpoints
- quota resumes with many prior attempts do not consume automatic crash recoveries
- own site polling surfaces the crash recovery limit without automatically resuming it

